# PrivateGit template: FPGA projects (Vivado / Vitis / Vitis HLS / PetaLinux / simulators)
# Copy into the project root as .gitignore.  Rule: commit SOURCES + Tcl scripts, never
# generated outputs (they are rebuilt, they are huge, and they cannot be merged).

